<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with an 7.50 pct coupon, and a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 7.75 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		   Oct 1,1999	Pvs    Sept 15,2001    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.40 pct    5.18 pct    5.76 pct     5.53 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.34 pct    6.13 pct    6.73 pct     6.50 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 103.20	 103.80     104.50	  105.50</p>
<p> Bids	     4.56 trln lire	   3.10 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.00 trln lire	   2.00 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on November 18 of a seventh tranche of three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
